Error [jet.UnknownMethod]: `Mat3` has no static method `identity`
  --> tests/ui/static_missing_core_member.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |     print(Mat3.identity().to_array()[0])
    |                ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Static lookup finds an associated method of `Mat3` with no `self` receiver, and `Mat3` declares none named `identity`
 Fix: Call a static method `Mat3` declares: `new`, `from_array`, `decode`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
